// ptr_diff's element size, split out because elem_ty(ex_ty(a_of(id))) is
// two levels of nested call and ptr_diff has no room left once the operand
// text and the final scale_txt are counted.
a_elem_sz(int id) {
  int aty = a_ty(id);
  int ety = elem_ty(aty);
  int sz = type_size(ety);
} return int sz;
given txt_fixture (0):(4) then calls elem_ty:(0)
given txt_fixture (1):(4) then calls elem_ty:(0)
